    },

    "detection_weight": 0.91,
    "_weight_rationale": "|avg| of concept_map: 10D + 1F. variable_binding defers (pragma fields are bound values). −10/11 ≈ −0.91.",

    // ===================================================================
    // CLOSING BLOCK [CLOSING]
    // ===================================================================

    "_X5_note": "Pragma identity is the file's answer to the deepest question: WHO are you? Four layers of identity, from the universal (I1 — your address in the graph) to the specific (I4 — your place in the architecture). When a file knows who it is, every decision that follows has a foundation. Identity precedes action.",
    "_X5_scripture": "Exodus 3:14 — And God said unto Moses, I AM THAT I AM. Identity is the foundation of all action."
}
